# ── local: your machine's instance of the full Mesh environment, deployed to
# mainnet by scripts/deploy.sh local (a real program — the locally-running
# backend pulls against it on-chain). Only PUBLIC values live in this file.
#
# UPGRADE_AUTHORITY — the wallet that controls this env's program: it pays
# for and signs every deploy/upgrade/close. Pubkey chosen by you; the private
# key stays in your wallet app (Phantom) and is pasted at the deploy prompt —
# never stored. If you later move the authority on-chain
# (solana program set-upgrade-authority), update this line to match.
UPGRADE_AUTHORITY=5gjUjStnVgooDXiJ8v5vtzXLCiXPyCJe8CqzQCay5zMq

# PULLER_KEYS — pubkeys allowed to trigger `pull` (baked into the binary by
# scripts/build.sh; change = edit here, then re-deploy). This is the key your
# locally-running backend signs pulls with; its private key lives in that
# backend's Key Vault / local secrets. Multiple space-separated keys are
# allowed (zero-downtime rotation); an EMPTY string is the kill switch.
# NOTE: never list the test seed keys here — this program is live on mainnet
# and their private keys are publicly derivable.
PULLER_KEYS="D8BXX8NxgxFN9LifSuDYQ8rTBfd9wfzVAL1KrntMBnU1 Edd4fi2ZnAwcYMyQ4PXttqk2pkPp7pwtdDeS6DsFqmBp"

# PROGRAM_ID — the smart contract's on-chain address (written by the first
# deploy: the pubkey of a random keypair scripts/deploy.sh mints and then
# discards; removed by close.sh — a closed id is burned; the next deploy
# mints a fresh one).
PROGRAM_ID=86NbSeZExe9NWqbvjN7TJBXZiqVVwJ8G8ekgU2M5vuPq
# ^ the smart contract address. Set BOTH backend settings to it (same value):
#   SolanaSubscriptionConfig--SmartContractAddress        (Core API app)
#   SolanaSubscriptionPullerConfig--SmartContractAddress  (Backend Functions app)
# The backend derives the MeshDelegate PDA from it by itself — not a config
# value. Informational, for cross-checking the backend's derivation; this PDA
# becomes the 'delegatee' recorded on each subscription (DB row + on-chain):
# MeshDelegate PDA = FSTmMVW8CH4iFZhkpWyw7r14Bx8SJiMET6BQp9be21M1
